"\u003eQuittin' Time\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Morgan Wallen Official Store","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45878517170490,"sku":"00602438985869","price":29.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0728\/8746\/8346\/files\/Dangerous-TheDoubleAlbumCassette.png?v=1695844352"},{"product_id":"dangerous-the-double-album-2cd-clean","title":"Dangerous: The Double Album 2CD (Clean)","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwo CDs. Includes two bonus tracks. Big Loud\/Republic Records' Morgan Wallen released his highly anticipated sophomore album, \u003cem\u003eDangerous: The Double Album\u003c\/em\u003e, in January 2021. The vast 30-track project was written largely by Wallen throughout the previous three years while he was becoming \"the fastest rising young star in country\" (Variety). Further establishing his signature sound, it includes a strong arsenal of writers and features \"More Than My Hometown,\" \"7 Summers,\" and more.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eAlbum Tracks\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDISC 1:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e1. Sand in My Boots\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e2. Wasted on You\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e3. Somebody's Problem\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e4. More Surprised Than Me\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e5. 865\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e6. Warning\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e7. Neon Eyes\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e8. Outlaw\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e9. Whiskey'd My Way\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e10. Wonderin' Bout the Wind\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e11. Your Bartender\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e12. Only Thing That's Gone\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e13. Cover Me Up\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e14. 7 Summers\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e15. More Than My Hometown\u003c